          "text": "Attachment:\n\nA - Copy of the Ufo-Genesis Group letter, dated April 13, 2004;\n\nB - Collection of Ufo-Genesis Group articles (92 pages); and\n\nC - Copy of Ofício N° C-4/CH/510-SECINT, dated August 25, 2004.",
