          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "1. I am sending to you a copy of the Letter from the Ufo-Genesis Group, dated April 13, 2004, where Mr. CLOVES ROQUE XAVIER requests \"to share,\" that is, to obtain from the Air Force Command information regarding research and monitoring of incidents involving \"Unidentified Flying Objects\" (UFO).\n\n2. On this subject, I inform you that on the website \"http://www.ufogenesis.com.br\" there are documents from the Air Force Command classified with the confidentiality level.\n\n3. Furthermore, I would like to inform you that this Department forwarded, on April 26, 2004, letters to EMAER and SECINT, requesting existing data within the scope of COMAER.\n\n4. With these considerations, and in light of the information contained in the letter No. C-4/CH/510-SECINT - annex \"C\", I consult you on the possibility of forwarding to this Department known elements regarding the developments of the attached files and/or other works; if they exist, and are related to this COMDABRA, they could be made available.\n\n5. If you consider it relevant and timely to comply with the aforementioned request, it is necessary to provide detailed information, which should remain restricted within the scope of DEPED and may be handled by the São Paulo Core.",
