          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "3XOANX - A system for the investigation of unidentified aerial objects (UAPs), established since March 1969 (4 Corner);\n\nUPA 09 - Aerospace norms and procedures, dated 20/08/1969, which provides guidelines for actions to be taken upon encountering these objects;\n\nRMA 205-1 - Regulation for the safeguarding of sensitive materials, Decree 79.099 of 06/01/77, detailing procedures for handling UAP-related actions;\n\n0101 - Specific Directive 04/89 - as referenced in the previous item - issued by the Directorate of Electronics and Air Defense.\n\nOperation Prato - Recognition action in the state of Pará in 1977 regarding the population's reports of UFO sightings.",
